invalid type: string "## 游戏预告片通用节奏模板\n\n游戏预告片通用节奏模板\n\n### Epic Action Trailer (史诗动作)\n```\nShot 1: Wide establishing — game world landscape, slow crane, atmospheric (opening)\nShot 2: Medium — hero character introduction, dolly-in, dramatic lighting (build-up)\nShot 3: Action montage — rapid cuts between combat/gameplay moments (climax)\n�